{"video":"iD4MAy8jAWc","lines":[{"t":[0,4.6],"en":"Ladies and gentlemen, I have heard your complaints, and we reached a settlement."},{"t":[5.2,8.7],"en":"So, we will be leaving the office for one whole week."},{"t":[8.9,10],"en":"Nice job."},{"t":[10.6,14.5],"en":"In my contract, it is stipulated that I provide a temporary workspace."},{"t":[14.8,16.2],"en":"It will arrive in one hour."},{"t":[16.5,16.7],"en":"What?"},{"t":[17.8,18.5],"en":"What's this?"},{"t":[18.7,19.5],"en":"Oh, what?"},{"t":[19.8,20.6],"en":"Bring it in."},{"t":[20.9,23.3],"en":"Roll into the future with Workbus."},{"t":[23.6,26],"en":"Say goodbye to wasteful buildings."},{"t":[26.5,29.3],"en":"These days, a mobile office isn't just for hotshot politicians."},{"t":[29.3,31.5],"en":"Now anyone can rent a Workbus."},{"t":[31.8,35.3],"en":"If you've got a parking lot, a workspace is just a phone call away."},{"t":[35.7,42.3],"en":"In this age of belt tightening and less empowered workers, a Workbus is how tomorrow gets things done."},{"t":[45.6,46.6],"en":"There are 100 pegs."},{"t":[46.6,47],"en":"See you, Freddy."},{"t":[47.3,48.7],"en":"No, no, no, 6 after 8."},{"t":[48.8,49.4],"en":"No, shh, shh."},{"t":[49.4,51.1],"en":"And it's $23.99 a case."},{"t":[51.1,51.4],"en":"Six?"},{"t":[51.7,51.9],"en":"Yes."},{"t":[52.9,53.8],"en":"Oh, sorry."},{"t":[53.8,54.6],"en":"Oh, my God."},{"t":[55.7,56.3],"en":"Sorry."},{"t":[56.6,57.5],"en":"Lose weight."},{"t":[58.1,58.6],"en":"I'm trying."},{"t":[58.7,59.4],"en":"Sorry."},{"t":[61.1,61.6],"en":"Stretch."},{"t":[62.6,63],"en":"Around."},{"t":[63.8,66.3],"en":"How many times do you need to take a stroll?"},{"t":[66.7,68.7],"en":"I, my legs cramp up, okay?"},{"t":[68.7,69.7],"en":"It's a circulation issue."},{"t":[69.7,71.3],"en":"Boy, I will hammer spank your rear."},{"t":[71.5,72.9],"en":"All right, all right, gang."},{"t":[73,73.9],"en":"Let's just settle down."},{"t":[74,74.8],"en":"You're yelling in her face."},{"t":[74.8,75.6],"en":"It's a medical thing."},{"t":[76.5,77.3],"en":"Just, we good?"},{"t":[77.8,78.5],"en":"I'm good."},{"t":[79,82.4],"en":"I, I'm so sorry for all of this."},{"t":[83,83.6],"en":"It's okay."},{"t":[84.6,85.5],"en":"You know what they say."},{"t":[85.6,87],"en":"A change is as good as a rest."},{"t":[88.1,89.8],"en":"I, I need to get to the paper, please."},{"t":[90.8,91.4],"en":"Oh, God."},{"t":[92.1,93.1],"en":"Oh, oh, my God."},{"t":[93.7,94.9],"en":"All right, I'll get you a napkin."},{"t":[95,96],"en":"Can someone get napkins, please?"},{"t":[96.1,96.4],"en":"You know what?"},{"t":[96.5,96.9],"en":"It's fine."},{"t":[97,97.5],"en":"It's fine."},{"t":[97.5,100.3],"en":"Pam, I'm really sorry."},{"t":[100.6,104.9],"en":"I just, I'm, I'm really sorry about all that."},{"t":[108.8,109.2],"en":"Really?"},{"t":[109.5,109.9],"en":"Smirking?"},{"t":[110.8,111.5],"en":"What can I say?"},{"t":[111.6,112.2],"en":"I love justice."},{"t":[112.8,114.7],"en":"You forced me to spend money on needless repairs,"},{"t":[115,117],"en":"and now you're locked in a prison bus,"},{"t":[117.3,118.8],"en":"and your woman drips with beverage."},{"t":[119,121.2],"en":"Hey, Dwight, I was trying to do something nice for Pam."},{"t":[121.3,123.1],"en":"Can you just help me out?"},{"t":[123.3,125.3],"en":"Can we maybe take this thing somewhere,"},{"t":[125.5,127.5],"en":"or do something to not make this the worst day ever?"},{"t":[127.8,130.6],"en":"It's not my responsibility to solve your marriage problems"},{"t":[130.6,132.9],"en":"by spending my money on gas."},{"t":[135.5,135.9],"en":"Andy!"},{"t":[137.5,138.5],"en":"Yo, dudeses."},{"t":[139,139.6],"en":"You're the boss."},{"t":[139.7,141.3],"en":"Don't you think we'd all be a lot more productive"},{"t":[141.3,142.3],"en":"if while we were doing work,"},{"t":[142.4,145.8],"en":"we looked up and saw the best rural pie stand in Pennsylvania?"},{"t":[146.3,147.9],"en":"Oh, I know I'd be more productive."},{"t":[148.2,148.9],"en":"As would I."},{"t":[149,149.8],"en":"No question."},{"t":[150.1,150.7],"en":"No, no."},{"t":[150.9,152.2],"en":"This is a work bus."},{"t":[152.5,154.6],"en":"The wheels are for transporting the workspace"},{"t":[154.6,156.1],"en":"to and from the work site."},{"t":[156.3,157.1],"en":"What are you talking about?"},{"t":[157.6,158.4],"en":"You're not the boss."},{"t":[158.7,159.2],"en":"Andy is."},{"t":[159.3,159.5],"en":"Andy?"},{"t":[164.9,165.5],"en":"All right."},{"t":[166.2,168.1],"en":"The fat people have spoken."},{"t":[169,170.9],"en":"Dwight, get this bus moving."},{"t":[171.4,171.8],"en":"Yeah!"},{"t":[173.8,177.2],"en":"Next up, Laverne's pies, tires fixed also."},{"t":[177.4,178.8],"en":"Oh, yes!"},{"t":[178.8,186.5],"en":"So it looks like this work bus was a pretty good idea after all, huh?"},{"t":[187.7,189.5],"en":"Get your foot behind the yellow line."},{"t":[189.6,190.1],"en":"You got it."},{"t":[190.1,190.3],"en":"Okay."},{"t":[192.2,192.7],"en":"Yeah!"},{"t":[193,193.3],"en":"Yeah!"},{"t":[193.3,193.4],"en":"Stop."},{"t":[193.4,193.8],"en":"Come back."},{"t":[193.8,205.7],"en":"Too late."},{"t":[205.7,208.4],"en":"Shabu-ya roll call."},{"t":[208.4,211.7],"en":"Shabu-ya, ya, ya, shabu-ya roll call."},{"t":[211.7,212.7],"en":"My name is Pam."},{"t":[213,213.3],"en":"Yeah!"},{"t":[213.3,214.4],"en":"I like to paint."},{"t":[214.6,215],"en":"Yeah!"},{"t":[215,216],"en":"You think you're better?"},{"t":[216,216.5],"en":"Yeah!"},{"t":[216.5,217.5],"en":"Oh, no, you ain't!"},{"t":[217.5,218.5],"en":"Roll call!"},{"t":[218.5,221.9],"en":"Shabu-ya, ya, ya, shabu-ya roll call."},{"t":[221.9,225.2],"en":"Shabu-ya, ya, ya, shabu-ya roll call."},{"t":[225.2,226.2],"en":"My name is Kevin."},{"t":[226.2,226.7],"en":"Yeah!"},{"t":[226.7,228.1],"en":"That is my name."},{"t":[228.1,228.6],"en":"Yeah!"},{"t":[228.6,229.8],"en":"They call me Kevin."},{"t":[229.8,230.5],"en":"Yeah!"},{"t":[230.5,231.6],"en":"Cause that's my name."},{"t":[231.6,232.6],"en":"Roll call!"},{"t":[232.6,236.1],"en":"Shabu-ya, ya, ya, shabu-ya roll call."},{"t":[236.1,239.5],"en":"Shabu-ya, ya, ya, shabu-ya roll call."},{"t":[248.5,249],"en":"Thanks."},{"t":[249,250.9],"en":"Playing a little hooky from work today."},{"t":[254.3,255.1],"en":"Oh, my God."},{"t":[260.5,276.8],"en":"Oh, my God."}]}
